      "content": "**Files:** .git, .opencode, bun.lock, docs/, examples/, node_modules, package.json, README.md, src/, tests/, trials/, tsconfig.json\n\n**Summary:**\n- **agent-harness**: a headless orchestration/observability layer over coding-agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Gemini, Kiro) with a normalized event model, cache-aware token accounting, and cost tracking.\n- Emits standard telemetry artifacts: ATIF trajectory files and OpenTelemetry `gen_ai` spans, plus per-agent state detection; CLI (`harness run/watch/stats/emit`) with state under `~/.agent-harness`.\n- TypeScript (ESM) project, tested with both tsx/node:test and bun; still WIP with `src/` populated by parallel workstreams per `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.",
